 "Hotkey: click, then press a key": "",
 "Welcome to Shadow of War Trainer, an in-game trainer for Middle-earth: Shadow of War. Everything runs inside the game and works through the game's own systems: skills are activated the way the skill menu does it, items arrive through the game's own inventory code, and gear changes are recalculated by the game itself.": "",
 "What it can do": "功能",
 "Infinite health, Focus, Might, Elf-Shot and Elven Rage, no summon cooldown, Wraith Chain without aiming.": "",
 "Level, skill points, Mirian, every skill and upgrade at once, Raise the Dead, prestige for every gear slot.": "",
 "Gear & Inventory": "装备与物品栏",
 "Edit any item's level, effects, look and rarity, copy or remove gear, add any captain gear, auto-complete gear challenges.": "",
 "Loot & Army": "掉落与军队",
 "Choose what captains drop. Edit followers, Instant Dominate, dominate captains at full health, create new orcs.": "",
